BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Arizona Wine Country Artists Village
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261123
DTSTAMP:20261113T184153Z
UID:feda1b7c2b1b2d2013459307@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Make a weekend of it in Old Town Cottonwood at the Arizona Win
 e Country Artists Village! From November 20–22\, explore a vibrant outdo
 or showcase of fine art and handcrafted treasures\, meet the artists behin
 d the work\, and experience the creativity that makes each piece unique. S
 pend the day browsing original artwork\, watching live demonstrations\, an
 d discovering one-of-a-kind pieces to take home or give as holiday gifts. 
 Bring the whole family to enjoy the hands-on children’s art tent\, and j
 oin the community scavenger hunt and raffle featuring donated artist origi
 nals\, with entries eligible for a $500 cash grand prize drawing. Set in t
 he heart of Arizona wine country at Old Town Activity Park\, the event is 
 just steps from Main Street’s charming boutiques\, local restaurants\, a
 nd wine tasting rooms. It’s a wonderful way to enjoy a fall weekend\, su
 pport regional artists\, and find something truly special along the way. E
 vent Details: Join us November 20–22\, 2026\, at Old Town Activity Park\
 , 187 E. Pima Street\, Cottonwood\, AZ. The event runs Friday and Saturday
  from 10 a.m. to 5 p.m. and Sunday from 10 a.m. to 4 p.m. Admission is fre
 e\, and the event is family- and pet-friendly. Plan your visit at[https://
 artists-village.com](https://artists-village.com/).\n\nEvent website: http
 s://artists-village.com/\n\nVisit Arizona listing: https://www.visitarizon
 a.com/events/arizona-wine-country-artists-village
LAST-MODIFIED:20261113T184153Z
