 eo+Gallery+FY27/AICE_Taliesin_West_Ad_2026.mp4) ‍ Experience the rich tr
 aditions and contemporary creativity of Arizona’s Native communities thr
 ough Indigenous culinary tastings\, desert-inspired cocktails\, live cooki
 ng demonstrations\, and a vibrant Native fashion showcase. Meet Indigenous
  chefs\, explore traditional and modern foodways\, and discover designs th
 at celebrate cultural heritage\, artistry\, and innovation. Set against th
 e stunning Sonoran Desert landscape\, this one-of-a-kind cultural celebrat
 ion takes place at Frank Lloyd Wright’s Taliesin West\, a UNESCO World H
 eritage Site. Presented by the Arizona Indigenous Culinary Experience\, th
 e evening also supports the Arizona American Indian Tourism Association (A
 AITA) and the Frank Lloyd Wright Foundation\, helping preserve and promote
  Indigenous culture\, heritage\, and tourism throughout Arizona. #### **Ev
 ent Details** **Date:**Saturday\, November 21\, 2026 **Time:** 6–9 p.m. 
 **Location:**Taliesin West **Address:**12621 N. Frank Lloyd Wright Blvd.\,
  Scottsdale\, AZ 85259 **Admission:**Adults $100 | VIP $175 | Tribal Parti
 cipants $50 **Tickets & Information:**[ArizonaNativeCulinary.org](https://
 www.arizonanativeculinary.org/) Celebrate the flavors\, fashion\, and livi
 ng traditions of Indigenous Arizona during an extraordinary evening where 
 culture\, culinary artistry\, and architecture come together. ‍ ![Image 
 46](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/683a4969614808c01cd0d378/6ad2adec54
 40824788fab1ad_Architecture-of-Indigenous-Flavor-and-Fashion-Social.jpg)\n
 \nEvent website: https://www.arizonanativeculinary.org/\n\nVisit Arizona l
 isting: https://www.visitarizona.com/events/the-architecture-of-indigenous
 -flavor-fashion-at-taliesin-west
LAST-MODIFIED:20261113T184153Z
LOCATION:12621 N Frank Lloyd Wright Blvd\, Scottsdale\, AZ 85259\, USA
URL:https://www.visitarizona.com/events/the-architecture-of-indigenous-fla
 vor-fashion-at-taliesin-west
END:VEVENT
